ROOSTACK-RELEASE-KEY-PLACEHOLDER

This file will hold Roostack's release public key: the armored OpenPGP
public key whose signing subkey signs every release's SHA256SUMS and the
apt repository. It's a placeholder until the Owner's key ceremony
(docs/RELEASING.md). While this text is here, the release workflow
refuses to run (scripts/sign-release.sh --check-key).
